\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Geico\uc2  workers accuse company of aggressive tactics to deter union push\b0\par\par\uc2 Michael Sainato \par \uc2 905 \uc2 words\par \uc2 3 October 2022\par 11:45 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2022.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Workers at the US insurance company vow to continue their efforts to organize as an independent labor movement takes hold\par \par \uc2 Workers at an office of the US insurance giant \uc2 Geico\uc2  have embarked on a unionization campaign in the face of what they say are aggressive and unfair management tactics to prevent them from forming a labor union.\par \par \uc2 Workers at the office of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wgrz.com/article/news/investigations/investigative-post/geico-workers-organizing-amherst-ny/71-38c7f6cc-6846-4e7e-b3c7-17f150155e40"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 about 2,500 employees}}}\uc2  in Amherst, New York, near Buffalo, say they have faced deteriorating working conditions in the past two years under the \uc2 Geico\uc2  CEO, \uc2 Todd Combs\uc2 . Combs is an investment manager and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2019/12/23/warren-buffett-protege-todd-combs-named-geico-ceo.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 protege}}}\uc2  of billionaire \uc2 Warren Buffett\uc2 , whose firm \uc2 Berkshire Hathaway\uc2  owns \uc2 Geico\uc2  \u8211\'20\'13 known across the US for its ads featuring its English-accented gecko mascot.\par \par \uc2 The organizing effort, Geico United, went public shortly after \uc2 Geico\uc2  sent out a company-wide email in August 2022 that told workers to call the police if they felt uncomfortable with union organisers collecting union authorization signatures.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nlrb.gov/about-nlrb/rights-we-protect/the-law/interfering-with-employee-rights-section-7-8a1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2  NLRB}}}\uc2  [\uc2 National Labor Relations Board\uc2 ] says that an employer should not hinder your activity, but they did,\u8221\'20\'1D said Lila Balali, an employee and organizer at \uc2 Geico\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Another email was sent out by \uc2 Geico\uc2  shortly after, which included several references to the \uc2 Starbucks\uc2  union campaign, in an effort to deter and dissuade union organizing with claims that the campaign hadn\u8217\'20\'19t yielded any benefits for workers.\par \par \uc2 Then, meetings with \uc2 Geico\uc2  management were held, and the union was discussed. After one of the meetings, Balali said the bulletin board where union flyers were posted was removed from the office.\par \par \uc2 The union has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/GeicoUnited/status/1571207329122590720"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2  filed}}}\uc2  unfair labor practice charges with the \uc2 NLRB\uc2 . New York state legislators {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/GeicoUnited/status/1569793868840767495?s=20&t=3n7uIlAIJflbPV2XaW_Gfg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sent a letter}}}\uc2  to \uc2 Geico\uc2  over the emails and actions, calling on the company to allow its employees to organize freely.\par \par \uc2 Workers explained the union organizing campaign took off in response to changes and issues that arose under \uc2 Geico\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s new CEO and the Covid-19 pandemic.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWhen the pandemic happened, I think I just got completely disillusioned when I realized \uc2 Geico\uc2  isn\u8217\'20\'19t what I thought it was, they\u8217\'20\'19re not what they portray themselves to be, at least as an employer,\u8221\'20\'1D added Balali.\par \par \uc2 We\u8217\'20\'19re just human beings that want to have a better working environment\par \par \uc2 Lonnie Konikoff, longtime \uc2 Geico\uc2  employee\par \par \uc2 Lonnie Konikoff, a longtime \uc2 Geico\uc2  employee in Amherst, New York, said that was exemplified through a subreddit of \uc2 Geico\uc2  employees, full of sentiments about degrading working conditions over the past couple of years.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe want to help \uc2 Geico\uc2 , we want to make \uc2 Geico\uc2  a better place to work,\u8221\'20\'1D said Konikoff. \u8220\'20\'1CWe\u8217\'20\'19re just human beings that want to have a better working environment for us, as well as our fellow workers, and to be compensated fairly. I think that is what every worker in America wants and we\u8217\'20\'19re simply not getting it at \uc2 Geico\uc2 .\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Several workers who spoke to the Guardian requested to remain anonymous for fear of retaliation.\par \par \uc2 The workers cited numerous changes since Combs was appointed in January 2020, including {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.hcamag.com/us/specialization/industrial-relations/geico-closes-california-offices/415844#:~:text=GEICO%20has%20closed%20all%20of,Fresno%20and%20one%20in%20Modesto."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the closure of 38 offices}}}\uc2  in California, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coverager.com/layoffs-at-geicos-rd-department/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 cutting}}}\uc2  the research and development department, changing sales metrics and disciplinary policies, insufficient training of new hires, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.barrons.com/articles/berkshire-hathaway-warren-buffett-geico-51663013589"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 inadequate equipment and technology}}}\uc2 , as well as not providing reimbursement for workers who had to work from home and purchase their own equipment at the beginning of the pandemic.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThere were a lot of good reasons to work for \uc2 Geico\uc2 , there was profit sharing, all sorts of incentives. All of that has since changed where they now basically expect us to almost be like a computer, taking back-to-back calls on a consistent basis,\u8221\'20\'1D said one worker in Amherst.\par \par \uc2 A \uc2 Geico\uc2  employee outside New York, who is also working on organizing a union and requested to keep their location and name secret for fear of retaliation, echoed those sentiments.\par \par \uc2 The worker explained amid drastic staffing cuts and consolidation of departments, there wasn\u8217\'20\'19t enough staff to complete the work that is needed, and they lose staff to competitors where pay, benefits and working conditions are better.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBecause of our staffing issues, there\u8217\'20\'19s not enough people to do all the work that needs to be done, and it has this big, crazy snowball effect,\u8221\'20\'1D the worker added.\par \par \uc2 Another \uc2 Geico\uc2  worker organizing at a separate office emphasized similar problems, citing cuts, consolidations and a lack of job security as pressing concerns for workers that corporate has ignored.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe have to organize in order to give ourselves a voice and a seat at the negotiating table to advocate for better pay, better job security, for more vacation and sick days for ourselves, for better advancement opportunities within the company,\u8221\'20\'1D they said.\par \par \uc2 A spokesperson for \uc2 Geico\uc2  said: \u8220\'20\'1CIn areas where we have been overstaffed because of lower volumes, we offered associates positions in other departments with comparable pay and better opportunities, and the company provides additional benefits if associates are displaced by major business changes. We care about our associates and work hard to find better opportunities for them within the company while adapting to changing customer demands.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The spokesperson added: \u8220\'20\'1C\uc2 Geico\uc2  associates have the right to support or oppose union representation. We respect these important rights. We believe that the allegations in the charges filed with the \uc2 National Labor Relations Board\uc2  are completely without merit.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 \u8226\'20\'22 This article was amended on 3 October 2022 to correct the spelling of Lila Balali\u8217\'20\'19s name.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020220930ei9u0015u\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
