\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Starbucks\uc2  creating \u8216\'20\'18culture of fear\u8217\'20\'19 as it fires dozens involved in union efforts\b0\par\par\uc2 Michael Sainato \par \uc2 688 \uc2 words\par \uc2 25 August 2022\par 09:01 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2022.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 More than 85 workers heavily involved in organizing at coffee chain dismissed in recent months, says Starbucks Workers United\par \par \uc2 More than 85 workers at \uc2 Starbucks\uc2  who were heavily involved in union organizing efforts at giant coffee chain have been fired over the past several months, according to the workers group Starbucks Workers United.\par \par \uc2 Workers have filed numerous unfair labor practice charges over the firings and a federal judge recently ordered the reinstatement of seven workers in Memphis, Tennessee, who were {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.commercialappeal.com/story/money/business/2022/05/11/starbucks-union-memphis-fired-workers-national-labor-relations-board/9735202002/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2  fired }}}\uc2  in February, a ruling \uc2 Starbucks\uc2  has said it {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/business/2022/aug/19/starbucks-ordered-to-reinstate-us-workers-fired-amid-union-campaign-tennessee"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 disagrees }}}\uc2  with and intends to appeal.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 National Labor Relations Board\uc2  has issued 21 official complaints against \uc2 Starbucks\uc2 , encompassing 81 charges and 548 allegations of labor law violations that are currently under review.\par \par \uc2 Starbucks\uc2  has accused the \uc2 NLRB\uc2  of favoring the union campaign and called for union elections to be temporarily suspended. The company has vehemently opposed unionization efforts as more than 220 stores have won union elections since December.\par \par \uc2 Starbucks Workers United have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/MorePerfectUS/status/1559989390742433792/photo/1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 called}}}\uc2  for \uc2 Starbucks\uc2  executives to testify before Congress on the company\u8217\'20\'19s response to the union campaign.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, fired workers have described their treatment. Jaysin Saxton, who worked at \uc2 Starbucks\uc2  in Augusta, Georgia, for over three years, was fired on 16 August. His store began organizing in January, publicly announced in March, and won their union election overwhelmingly at the end of April.\par \par \uc2 Saxton said that a couple of months ago after a new manager was brought into the store, workers started receiving intense scrutiny and disciplinary measures.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThat\u8217\'20\'19s when everything went downhill. They started writing people up a lot, ranging from documented coachings and final written warnings so workers couldn\u8217\'20\'19t transfer or be promoted,\u8221\'20\'1D said Saxton. \u8220\'20\'1CThey surveil us. It\u8217\'20\'19s insane. They just created this intense culture of fear in the store and are trying to push us all out.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 In July, Saxton led a march on the boss to present a list of demands from the workers, a protest that managers shut down. Saxton said he was fired over claims he was disruptive during the protest.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI expressed to my district manager that I was being treated as the stereotypical angry black man,\u8221\'20\'1D said Saxton over how he was treated by managers for trying to address issues and grievances workers were experiencing in the store.\par \par \uc2 About a month later, Saxton received a call from his manager telling him he was being terminated, though he said he hadn\u8217\'20\'19t received any write-up or discipline from the protest before the call. He immediately filed the paperwork to submit an unfair labor practice charge allegation over his firing.\par \par \uc2 More than 80 strikes have been held by workers at \uc2 Starbucks\uc2  over unfair labor practice claims, firings of union leaders, withholding of benefits for unionized stores and delays in first contract negotiations. The union created a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2022/aug/11/starbucks-union-drive-strikes"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 strike fund }}}\uc2  to help support workers on strike and several \uc2 GoFundMe\uc2  campaigns have been {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.gofundme.com/f/help-fired-starbucks-organizer-pay-her-bills"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 created}}}\uc2  to financially support union leaders who have faced termination.\par \par \uc2 Joselyn Chuquillanqui, 28, and a shift supervisor for seven years at \uc2 Starbucks\uc2  in Great Neck Plaza, New York, was fired in July for what she said was excessive write-ups for being late. She said after her store came up short by one vote in their union election in May, she had been pushed out by management.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI was getting written up for being late by under five minutes,\u8221\'20\'1D said Chuqillanqui. \u8220\'20\'1CThey tried to vilify me, implying I was getting paid by the union.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Her co-workers and community supporters recently held a rally outside the \uc2 Starbucks\uc2  store in support of her and demanding her reinstatement, where {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/LIProgress/status/1559332400047575040"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 dozens of supporters chanted }}}\uc2  \u8220\'20\'1Crehire Joselyn\u8221\'20\'1D. The union intends to file an unfair labor practice complaint over her firing.\par \par \uc2 Starbucks\uc2  has denied all allegations of retaliation. A spokesperson said in an email: \u8220\'20\'1CThese individuals are no longer with \uc2 Starbucks\uc2  for store policy violations. A partner\u8217\'20\'19s interest in a union does not exempt them from the standards we have always held. We will continue enforcing our policies consistently for all partners.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020220825ei8p0015q\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
