\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Anthony Fauci\uc2  tests positive for Covid with mild symptoms\b0\par\par\uc2 Erum Salam \par \uc2 165 \uc2 words\par \uc2 15 June 2022\par 20:14 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2022.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Biden\u8217\'20\'19s chief medical adviser received two booster shots and is working from home, says \uc2 National Institutes of Health\par \par \uc2 Dr \uc2 Anthony Fauci\uc2 , Joe Biden\u8217\'20\'19s chief medical adviser and director of the \uc2 National Institute of Allergy and Infectious Diseases\uc2 , tested positive for Covid-19 on Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 A {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nih.gov/news-events/news-releases/niaid-director-fauci-tests-positive-covid-19"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 statement}}}\uc2  issued by the \uc2 National Institutes of Health\uc2  (\uc2 NIH\uc2 ) said the doctor had mild symptoms and was vaccinated with two subsequent booster shots.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CDr Fauci will isolate and continue to work from his home \u8230\'20\'26 Dr Fauci will follow the Covid-19 guidelines of the \uc2 Centers for Disease Control and Prevention\uc2  and medical advice from his physician and return to the \uc2 NIH\uc2  when he tests negative.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Fauci, who is 81, has not recently been in close contact with Biden.\par \par \uc2 Under the Trump administration, Fauci was a lead member of the White House coronavirus taskforce. This is the first known positive Covid-19 result for the infectious disease expert.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020220615ei6f003h1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
