ion of independents challenging Coalition MPs}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/film/2022/mar/13/william-hurt-a-magnetic-mischievous-actor-who-invigorated-hollywood"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 William Hurt: a magnetic, mischievous actor who invigorated Hollywood}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2022/mar/11/diana-totok-ukraine-escape-tiktok"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \u8216\'20\'18Like a horror movie\u8217\'20\'19: 19-year-old shares Ukraine escape on TikTok}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/football/2022/mar/12/matthijs-de-ligt-the-dirty-work-is-so-important-i-find-it-really-nice"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Matthijs de Ligt: \u8216\'20\'18The dirty work is so important. I find it really nice}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/film/2022/mar/07/tony-walton-obituary"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tony Walton obituary}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/commentisfree/2022/mar/02/time-to-confront-trump-putin-network"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 It\u8217\'20\'19s time to confront the Trump-Putin network}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/lifeandstyle/2022/mar/07/a-new-start-after-60-i-became-a-psychotherapist-at-69-and-found-my-calling"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 A new start after 60: \u8216\'20\'18I became a psychotherapist at 69 and found my calling\u8217\'20\'19}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/environment/2022/mar/10/climate-change-fundamentally-affecting-european-birds-study-shows"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Climate change fundamentally affecting European birds, study shows}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/film/2022/mar/04/fantastic-beasts-3-secrets-of-dumbledoor-return-to-hogwarts-week-in-geek"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Can Fantastic Beasts 3\u8217\'20\'19s return to Hogwarts save JK Rowling\u8217\'20\'19s Wizarding World?}}}\p